## documents
  * 1 December 1999 — Meeting Summary
    Covers the opening day's ministerial discussions.
    Topics included agriculture, market access, export subsidies, and other trade negotiations.

  * 2 December 1999 — Meeting Summary
    Covers the second day's discussions.
    Includes work on the draft Ministerial Declaration and discussions concerning trade and labor standards and other systemic issues.

  * 3 December 1999 — Meeting Summary
    Covers the final day's discussions.
    Describes the final negotiations and the difficulties in reaching agreement.